{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/3laykzrc2n0ixr7p8ahq0f0l8uvuv6n.mp3","text":"你想要一个护卫，还是一个随时督促你工作的长官？开个玩笑，过去的工作我没忘记。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/3lihx9tw4zcqdqg4huetenf9gi79ad8.mp3","text":"你想要一个护卫，还是一个随时督促你工作的长官？开个玩笑，过去的工作我没忘记。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/7gvqavjuk3ncgpnboxkzwiepq9p7zeo.mp3","text":"罗德岛的访客记录？诗怀雅，星熊，还有林......好，我姑且相信她们会经常来过问我的近况，可是这个频率，总不能每次都是因为——嗯，我知道很多人都在等着我，有人记挂的感觉，不坏。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/ij272kkcjnl7henxz2q8etoheivufsh.mp3","text":"在意我的病情？看来我们要互相监督按时体检了，博士。这些年的经历的确算得上充实，几乎让我忘了时间。可所见越多，越容易陷入不知所措的迷茫。有时候我也需要被提醒......时间紧张。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/bzge3zi9gjfpzeo9iyg04keyw53fvrz.mp3","text":"哦，你注意到这把剑了。把它交给我的那个人说，它可以用来抹除历史的错误。可这上千年的故纸堆，一大半都是用错误写就的，靠一把剑怎么能抹得干净呢。向前看吧，我们要找的理想不在身后。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/o05mgnsibjjgf9td8g29b9zwoemh00w.mp3","text":"罗德岛的访客记录？诗怀雅，星熊，还有林......好，我姑且相信她们会经常来过问我的近况，可是这个频率，总不能每次都是因为——嗯，我知道很多人都在等着我，有人记挂的感觉，不坏。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/96/2edas0x6cuxnhse0ncphsjvpwevewyu.mp3","text":"在意我的病情？看来我们要互相监督按时体检了，博士。这些年的经历的确算得上充实，几乎让我忘了时间。可所见越多，越容易陷入不知所措的迷茫。有时候我也需要被提醒......时间紧张。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/10fqhaqtyb7c71ygn0si8t47ew0sj6m.mp3","text":"哦，你注意到这把剑了。把它交给我的那个人说，它可以用来抹除历史的错误。可这上千年的故纸堆，一大半都是用错误写就的，靠一把剑怎么能抹得干净呢。向前看吧，我们要找的理想不在身后。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/bs9ar8xsb4mfpwo4i9d1hv76q680xk7.mp3","text":"我跟随她还有整合运动的行踪又去过很多地方，也见证了无数牺牲。人们从迷失、犹豫，到团结、觉醒，那是一条蜿蜒曲折的路。很多人留在了圣骏堡的那场大火里，但也是火，点燃了希望。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/128hcsfba8365ot19d7xudat8w55o5v.mp3","text":"一个对所有人都公正的地方，依然是遥远的理想，我也不知道自己是否离它近了一些。我从不怀疑理想中的公正是否存在，当我们为所见的不公愤怒时，当我们想要挺身而出时，它就是存在的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/s8p3zpe9m7be2ana39cu0vd4s0f4bhg.mp3","text":"我跟随她还有整合运动的行踪又去过很多地方，也见证了无数牺牲。人们从迷失、犹豫，到团结、觉醒，那是一条蜿蜒曲折的路。很多人留在了圣骏堡的那场大火里，但也是火，点燃了希望。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/fwnk1l3snptqfxjdr9nrdpre0iwv753.mp3","text":"一个对所有人都公正的地方，依然是遥远的理想，我也不知道自己是否离它近了一些。我从不怀疑理想中的公正是否存在，当我们为所见的不公愤怒时，当我们想要挺身而出时，它就是存在的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/bk8csdnqpcx9ibp9qytakxdcm2r6bqd.mp3","text":"后来我回过龙门几次，除了最熟悉的肠粉店不见了，其他都是令人欣喜的变化。街上的近卫局成员越来越少，从人们口中也渐渐听不到贫民区这个词了......我没法骗自己不在意这座城市。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/stli286zhbm4y0ndrt59506mf5wnxy6.mp3","text":"我向那个人追问母亲与姐姐悲剧的缘由，不出所料地，没有得到想要的答案。可惜赤霄剑斩不断血脉，这柄书刀也无法抹除过往。我不能代替她们去原谅，没有人该成为“大义”的代价，绝对没有。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/sf4qwsv1jymca66udl5fn90xauebiad.mp3","text":"等闲下来，真想带你一起去炎国看看。不仅是龙门，也无关调研考察。只是去看看山河形胜，还有筚路蓝缕却生生不息的人，都是独一无二的风景。也用不着做什么准备，一把剑，一叶小舟，足矣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/nllg5g98woxdcl1qjzq99khdslknbc0.mp3","text":"后来我回过龙门几次，除了最熟悉的肠粉店不见了，其他都是令人欣喜的变化。街上的近卫局成员越来越少，从人们口中也渐渐听不到贫民区这个词了......我没法骗自己不在意这座城市。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/ldq1kxelrngh6qcqgl0eeg8a5htocle.mp3","text":"我向那个人追问母亲与姐姐悲剧的缘由，不出所料地，没有得到想要的答案。可惜赤霄剑斩不断血脉，这柄书刀也无法抹除过往。我不能代替她们去原谅，没有人该成为“大义”的代价，绝对没有。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/q752ov558x59khcfb1z3ry5suhfevyu.mp3","text":"等闲下来，真想带你一起去炎国看看。不仅是龙门，也无关调研考察。只是去看看山河形胜，还有筚路蓝缕却生生不息的人，都是独一无二的风景。也用不着做什么准备，一把剑，一叶小舟，足矣。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/1klu7wrww5rxvua3uqv6ei28dtqwmlt.mp3","text":"想休息但睡不着？你也积累了不少压力啊。坐好，教你一套炎国特有的吐纳功法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/g9xdgpurpxz9vlv5yhtu6ua715q0azu.mp3","text":"想休息但睡不着？你也积累了不少压力啊。坐好，教你一套炎国特有的吐纳功法。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/gbgl90m74d6ff6fq8iczndc1xsq74ni.mp3","text":"博士，好久不见。我知道罗德岛当前的状况不容乐观，我会回来提供一份助力。也以防你忘记，我依然是罗德岛的一员。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/no62fu30hocp1i6mmkvk3mfe3ib845c.mp3","text":"博士，好久不见。我知道罗德岛当前的状况不容乐观，我会回来提供一份助力。也以防你忘记，我依然是罗德岛的一员。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/63jn6n0xxzz6bckwozledzmzijakuow.mp3","text":"这里的战场......原来当时罗德岛也在？","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/bs7ve5s8o11uqmol7pxf5vmj8jmcrnz.mp3","text":"这里的战场......原来当时罗德岛也在？","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/t27wspbcwwp62e3s6o3sv6igbq9u66w.mp3","text":"许多人信赖你的指挥，也会倚靠你指引的方向......这很重要。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/fewf1c39qnwdv288kcag5pmkiiyu08j.mp3","text":"许多人信赖你的指挥，也会倚靠你指引的方向......这很重要。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/ellbg9axrfpdv8zyhy6i3ag9n6mlmol.mp3","text":"我花了很长时间来参悟赤霄剑法，但得出的答案不同于以往接受的任何教导。赤霄见证了我的决心，当你需要这把剑的时候，它不会有任何迟疑。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/rmtili4hp334tty0i7s2h8ze3dqqtiy.mp3","text":"我花了很长时间来参悟赤霄剑法，但得出的答案不同于以往接受的任何教导。赤霄见证了我的决心，当你需要这把剑的时候，它不会有任何迟疑。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/7477q5nkprzipv5eaylm00651y1by0b.mp3","text":"还不算生疏。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/fpdq8g62f6vc891ylmgrn7n0m6m4hzi.mp3","text":"还不算生疏。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/oz9p8mgtfb3lm91s5lqjy03c1to0d0j.mp3","text":"放心，这些年我不总是独行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/l7xh8qu6grvijojc9nfik9k2g62h14a.mp3","text":"放心，这些年我不总是独行。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/o6prp1ziaqittzwy8hracjvw0z4r5gq.mp3","text":"出发，我会确保没有人掉队。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/991n1jl8xe143nulfjiso8tlz9dln92.mp3","text":"出发，我会确保没有人掉队。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/a4t8myzm0qvnxtft2ikpumtdt9ko8fq.mp3","text":"这不是一场旨在暴力倾轧的战斗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/dqi1yvqvobri6mywi6w3ptr49chswqf.mp3","text":"这不是一场旨在暴力倾轧的战斗。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/5nx4fa4alhsbscdj5j88a03na6axk9k.mp3","text":"不必畏惧这把剑的力量。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/be/rfa56xi2v3kui1sreog6uxluh65qmpf.mp3","text":"我很清楚拔剑的理由。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/2tein63n9npaazfhksy16w3s03qblhn.mp3","text":"不必畏惧这把剑的力量。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/iiw71ytgauzm623rh3qr8zdedw2bzdx.mp3","text":"我很清楚拔剑的理由。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/mqcjm982ksq6bfqwubgwtnzd72rvb3s.mp3","text":"我会阻止一切恶行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/5z1b1d5mlb92ctq9gm0c8lv3b2j5rag.mp3","text":"赤霄，拔刀——","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/3mgq4utwyrs8k1j7uhtwb38f0ugj4mz.mp3","text":"我会阻止一切恶行。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/dyzpm0w2aohcix0hsivaluqne4eq3q9.mp3","text":"赤霄，拔刀——","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/p319927u4po89pkaex7v78i67iu5rqe.mp3","text":"拔刀之招，当破即破。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/1doh7z5kv5eqtrt2hcsjbvfumebybmi.mp3","text":"泪锋之招，当断即断......","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/ip5oxn41ewljhndlnbtqsw10w073xs7.mp3","text":"云裂之剑，当立则立！","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/f3i96ufuqbsq7yy3pgbku3fv6b7sgxx.mp3","text":"天喟之剑，当明则明。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/quiue1y73k6z1n148i8hbir3fyrd7xl.mp3","text":"拔刀之招，当破即破。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/80h1qilycvwtkao7udxjekqca46y9ff.mp3","text":"泪锋之招，当断即断......","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/06n84aqd09dobkydi9g8mo4ii1s6f5f.mp3","text":"云裂之剑，当立则立！","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/ez21luf41kzvggo4jukfohizsuqi5ih.mp3","text":"天喟之剑，当明则明。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/8cnk7og0hcwjzhatly7jn8ipaq9d5qr.mp3","text":"顺利结束，博士......你看错了，那道天光不是来自我的剑法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/97/0076nd8iw231k4fnleatlj0agcxvim9.mp3","text":"顺利结束，博士......你看错了，那道天光不是来自我的剑法。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/tebxi7vhz8heqe06pxtn9z46kxt1hsd.mp3","text":"总有一天，我们可以不用在剑锋上寻找公义。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/ptiwknmc2jghwbm1wv3kwru2mj4lukh.mp3","text":"总有一天，我们可以不用在剑锋上寻找公义。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/5xc7rgd3c7fb3yk1sqazb7tt9sbzmr6.mp3","text":"他们最好珍惜悔过的机会。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/53/78faplofzkks70z1kasaool2ptzxxnb.mp3","text":"他们最好珍惜悔过的机会。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/o8wzblllldxrjq8xdnz7b1waxtigtxr.mp3","text":"打起精神，你不该因为这点挫折丧气。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/gu2ud7ru9hlc36zmbbg7ywalw46n7lq.mp3","text":"打起精神，你不该因为这点挫折丧气。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/65eppjb05ey204h1zh8hu7h3y7p010e.mp3","text":"布置和原来一样，不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/dwouhzrv2xtyxknzo8mdjs3cht2iq8s.mp3","text":"布置和原来一样，不错。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/h5so2jqpxavootg9rrxr6akfjwo50fm.mp3","text":"博士，当心剑锋。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/d01f6rcvf3n3bnk0ttrmn0gdcyeh4bp.mp3","text":"博士，当心剑锋。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/3hm8wldth7naorp48qyp68csegp2vca.mp3","text":"不用确认了，我还是我，一点没变。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/qx8zo9s5pyo1w0ahgnxeouqcns2oyup.mp3","text":"不用确认了，我还是我，一点没变。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/n5t9kg32km8uno8sg2vka556ah2ek4x.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/tnsl5vi95x6xms78lufouzcjsvfu3dy.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/sudd96qszxcn9pzilgtvwfhrr4jd4n3.mp3","text":"我见过不同地方的新年，有人会在巨大的源石晶簇下避雨，用浑浊的泥水碰杯，告诉彼此一切都会好的，然后沉默着等待太阳升起......没什么，博士。难得的节日，去和大家一起庆祝吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/o5rgkn6ewzjwg58o9dtyunlwjgi87rr.mp3","text":"我见过不同地方的新年，有人会在巨大的源石晶簇下避雨，用浑浊的泥水碰杯，告诉彼此一切都会好的，然后沉默着等待太阳升起......没什么，博士。难得的节日，去和大家一起庆祝吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/1hrfgu9eyttyv1102ckisxm42b7ut1z.mp3","text":"博士，一点都没变呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1050_chen3/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/9wgt7lbcc87yn0nd51gqqu0pk2e4mx9.mp3","text":"博士，一点都没变呢。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1050_chen3_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/figf7u2ugf6iuxziyh3ff5tbmcle4hj.mp3","text":"你想要一个护卫，还是一个随时督促你工作的长官？开个玩笑，过去的工作我没忘记。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/qcmx7pba3e7nltjqn18rx92rotp0yok.mp3","text":"罗德岛的访客记录？诗怀雅，星熊，还有林......好，我姑且相信她们会经常来过问我的近况，可是这个频率，总不能每次都是因为——嗯，我知道很多人都在等着我，有人记挂的感觉，不坏。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/62hmpxv3id8iliqzt5foilfcgy5r0co.mp3","text":"在意我的病情？看来我们要互相监督按时体检了，博士。这些年的经历的确算得上充实，几乎让我忘了时间。可所见越多，越容易陷入不知所措的迷茫。有时候我也需要被提醒......时间紧张。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/ld2pafrf540vx0cjti0ic5tu0kdq66v.mp3","text":"哦，你注意到这把剑了。把它交给我的那个人说，它可以用来抹除历史的错误。可这上千年的故纸堆，一大半都是用错误写就的，靠一把剑怎么能抹得干净呢。向前看吧，我们要找的理想不在身后。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/6bdo90hz2lbea8r491dfttcokk7uv2j.mp3","text":"我跟随她还有整合运动的行踪又去过很多地方，也见证了无数牺牲。人们从迷失、犹豫，到团结、觉醒，那是一条蜿蜒曲折的路。很多人留在了圣骏堡的那场大火里，但也是火，点燃了希望。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/o2z5emuz7p9s7te81l2x9rozb3pxafl.mp3","text":"一个对所有人都公正的地方，依然是遥远的理想，我也不知道自己是否离它近了一些。我从不怀疑理想中的公正是否存在，当我们为所见的不公愤怒时，当我们想要挺身而出时，它就是存在的。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/6dvs0mu5lxb3fq3q4ut57pc0pomaldj.mp3","text":"后来我回过龙门几次，除了最熟悉的肠粉店不见了，其他都是令人欣喜的变化。街上的近卫局成员越来越少，从人们口中也渐渐听不到贫民区这个词了......我没法骗自己不在意这座城市。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/n2ccmygknljz9xeeu0c24cbvhe3ul8h.mp3","text":"我向那个人追问母亲与姐姐悲剧的缘由，不出所料地，没有得到想要的答案。可惜赤霄剑斩不断血脉，这柄书刀也无法抹除过往。我不能代替她们去原谅，没有人该成为“大义”的代价，绝对没有。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/gmhxwu9q3jsjv8niljlcwfsi9u57c0p.mp3","text":"等闲下来，真想带你一起去炎国看看。不仅是龙门，也无关调研考察。只是去看看山河形胜，还有筚路蓝缕却生生不息的人，都是独一无二的风景。也用不着做什么准备，一把剑，一叶小舟，足矣。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/ea07ulbz6wfv9ocebhye01yad6nfs6q.mp3","text":"想休息但睡不着？你也积累了不少压力啊。坐好，教你一套炎国特有的吐纳功法。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/f6metf97k7n8abspge6hawvsdveldpf.mp3","text":"博士，好久不见。我知道罗德岛当前的状况不容乐观，我会回来提供一份助力。也以防你忘记，我依然是罗德岛的一员。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/0xpoj1xf5xrdy7sj9zwkoeg74h5j6yd.mp3","text":"这里的战场......原来当时罗德岛也在？","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/hi5u6qac8uzq4tucuuc2p3dus8rljtr.mp3","text":"许多人信赖你的指挥，也会倚靠你指引的方向......这很重要。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/c2sbj2bj7ssdwr6qr9n51gamatvzyi2.mp3","text":"我花了很长时间来参悟赤霄剑法，但得出的答案不同于以往接受的任何教导。赤霄见证了我的决心，当你需要这把剑的时候，它不会有任何迟疑。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/hy008qc592ahmqym3japbca5ee4u1s2.mp3","text":"还不算生疏。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/9ugncl6g93tt6m2cxkzggam6hsm9dv3.mp3","text":"放心，这些年我不总是独行。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/il76agypt3bhd2cwr621gmjr8w35utz.mp3","text":"出发，我会确保没有人掉队。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/kbvq68nin7eyy7q9jid3oskfui94a2b.mp3","text":"这不是一场旨在暴力倾轧的战斗。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/29zi2klcf3tyz80u2pyvilhfk1dr52r.mp3","text":"不必畏惧这把剑的力量。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/97/0xcfxplp65s6elirukcj1d70b498szi.mp3","text":"我很清楚拔剑的理由。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/j3yfw7rd818w0yrtq9fbig3pw7zrg2f.mp3","text":"我会阻止一切恶行。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/jahtl62n6dxj0tsi9g31hwju51j7sd3.mp3","text":"赤霄，拔刀——","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/f3pduexxr7ckh3t8hkd2igbftf4okc3.mp3","text":"拔刀之招，当破即破。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/spy5a1aqb6b28h3qreb8t5wklrmutbk.mp3","text":"泪锋之招，当断即断......","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/l0b01lbw2tewcbccio3a4dma3o5su7d.mp3","text":"云裂之剑，当立则立！","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/td876y9t0wxxorf3v3me8cms7nu3nl2.mp3","text":"天喟之剑，当明则明。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/17foogr7ovl8jedtlw5xf90vshs7zr2.mp3","text":"顺利结束，博士......你看错了，那道天光不是来自我的剑法。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/b77ihkja5lrjngul8bwohp48qytoe3o.mp3","text":"总有一天，我们可以不用在剑锋上寻找公义。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/pb9a2cdf3fhir169pp3pplh5q1spnrr.mp3","text":"他们最好珍惜悔过的机会。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/0zpok8tm42avzgvgq787vgm1llwl87r.mp3","text":"打起精神，你不该因为这点挫折丧气。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/300i0qw5au772z2s80oidqf7klvdtwu.mp3","text":"布置和原来一样，不错。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/gl8ayq0rmq3949acy3r6vkbeui0lh7k.mp3","text":"博士，当心剑锋。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/fb7czevhkb5tvafbvqq3ukly5bcyu2b.mp3","text":"不用确认了，我还是我，一点没变。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/kl8a5cjjc9w1s21df65fg5hkqm0hm3l.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/db9y8hsvcdbw4xst8kg8ucdh9h8acd5.mp3","text":"我见过不同地方的新年，有人会在巨大的源石晶簇下避雨，用浑浊的泥水碰杯，告诉彼此一切都会好的，然后沉默着等待太阳升起......没什么，博士。难得的节日，去和大家一起庆祝吧。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/sf7gqvmx9n2jxr5m1xqutzesahpc1i0.mp3","text":"博士，一点都没变呢。","alt":"voice/char_1050_chen3/cn_042.mp3"}]}}